<title>CHILE: Entel Chile 9-mo net rises.</title>
<headline>Entel Chile 9-mo net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecommunications company Entel Chile SA reported the following results in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>				 9-mo 1996	  9-mo 1995</p>
<p> Net profit			8.36    profit  6.86</p>
<p> Operating profit	     15.58    profit 11.98</p>
<p> Non-operating loss	    6.81     loss   4.62</p>
<p> Revenues			 98.39	     90.86</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
</text>
